","role":"Tikfin / Hamsetrfin / Motyafin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKCqEXjXcix2flzcOXL9hUGPKs3.jpg"},{"id":2297345,"name":"Aleksandr Gudkov","role":"Mafin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8I0VRPFeAsy2rMGoANhj4YJGFu7.jpg"},{"id":3426973,"name":"Artur Babich","role":"Pinkfin / Flyufin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2cvukARHhLwwZrdhjHXmhtgWcSo.jpg"},{"id":992790,"name":"Andrey Lyovin","role":"Dzhey Bi (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97IH5cLXtNFh1zBQUo1tFdkkqL7.jpg"},{"id":2735398,"name":"Ivan Chaban","role":"Mark (voice)"},{"id":110037,"name":"Mikhail Chernyak","role":"reporter (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rXvPKpty9486cVTyr1X9G2la08D.jpg"},{"id":1319240,"name":"Maxim Sergeev","role":"narrator / director (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/geWeLT1PbkZtNQ6nDvQkSFauAkq.jpg"},{"id":1250723,"name":"Svetlana Kuznetsova","role":"director’s assistant (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lMQ9BGMqlSrZ9OYQCvVyMZytfds.jpg"},{"id":2470571,"name":"Boris Khasanov","role":"Grandfaserin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eYQNsteZNMDepktNkhdXi0YW1zM.jpg"},{"id":992789,"name":"Vladimir Maslakov","role":"Blackfin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pnzpi6L7ymGSdZW1BLK40gOat25.jpg"},{"id":1628829,"name":"Sergey Mardar","role":"Dogfin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nypBDcXmjEm0W1BifnS32JYEp7N.jpg"},{"id":110848,"name":"Valeri Solovyev","role":"detective (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cSnBCbnuYWCMZKaDye2BZTYsASc.jpg"},{"id":2189362,"name":"Igor Yakovel","role":"Villain (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8vSJWgEEqHb4Eie2MQco8Xab8Rk.jpg"},{"id":1240127,"name":"Vladimir Postnikov","role":"postman (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8qA7nbI3BwpgdtkQKXmjGW6z2mq.jpg"},{"id":3849700,"name":"Iurii Romanov","role":"Domovoy (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDHanmGHFqmug9IMx4QV4FERAKt.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Il mio amico Finnick","overview":"Non molti sanno che ogni casa è abitata da finlandesi. Sono creature pelose che appaiono nel mondo umano per prendersi cura di una casa e mantenere il focolare. Finnick è un giovane finlandese, a cui non sembra importare della sua responsabilità di creare una casa fuori casa. Sta solo facendo scherzi al «suo popolo» ed è per questo che nessuna delle famiglie ha voluto rimanere a lungo a casa sua. Tutto cambia quando una nuova famiglia arriva a casa sua, dove i trucchi di Finnick non funzionano affatto, e incontra Christine, 13 anni, e in città iniziano ad accadere eventi inspiegabili. Finnick e Christine, che sono così diversi, dovranno collaborare e collaborare per risolvere il mistero degli eventi e salvare la città.","tagline":"Il mio amico Finnick"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Finnick","overview":"Not many people know that every house is secretly inhabited by little monsters! These furry creatures take care of a family’s house but cannot be seen. Finnick is a little monster, who doesn’t seem to care about his responsibility of making a home out of the house. But everything changes after a new family comes to his house. When Finn meets 13-year-old Christine, inexplicable events begin to happen in the city and life will never be the same again!","tagline":"There's one in every house."},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Мало кто знает, но в каждом доме живет… свой домовой! Это забавное мохнатое существо тайно обитает в мире людей и хранит домашний очаг. Домовой Финник — добрый, озорной, но немного вредный. Он любит подшутить над жильцами своего дома, поэтому ни одна семья не задерживается в его владениях надолго. Но все меняется, когда в дом въезжают находчивая девочка Кристина и ее родители: на них уловки домового совсем не действуют! Вскоре Кристина знакомится с Финником и узнает тайны жизни домовых. Тем временем, в их городке начинают происходить странные и пугающие события… Отважной девочке и домовому придется стать командой, чтобы разобраться в происходящем и спасти город.","tagline":"«В семье не без домового»"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orDQ0S2D4gTt6GBN5ULXYzjdKYY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cH5mdqHFVUuZ7Votxfkki4pd4HT.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":597845,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orDQ0S2D4gTt6GBN5ULXYzjdKYY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/orDQ0S2D4gTt6GBN5ULXYzjdKYY.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/orDQ0S2D4gTt6GBN5ULXYzjdKYY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/orDQ0S2D4gTt6GBN5ULXYzjdKYY.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmZGAbI42ecAoixyvZI0Se4Qiau.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gmZGAbI42ecAoixyvZI0Se4Qiau.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gmZGAbI42ecAoixyvZI0Se4Qiau.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gmZGAbI42ecAoixyvZI0Se4Qiau.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3r1iE5H2GMjsA2QNpp6eWOehs6h.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3r1iE5H2GMjsA2QNpp6eWOehs6h.jpg","language":"en","width":920,"height":1379},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/e1gaY3elQjbJ0D7D720pgBRjTxe.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e1